CALLER REPORTING THE DISCHARGE OF APPROX (2500) GALLONS OF JET A FUEL, FROM THE VENT AND SUMP PUMP PRODUCT RECOVERY TANK, TO THE PAD AND SURROUNDING  ASPHALT DUE TO AN UNKNOWN TANK MALFUNCTION. FURTHER INVESTIGATION IS  UNDERWAY. 

